  which can be wrong if one or both models returned hard labels.

A second issue is that the validation predictions are made directly on `valid_part` while training used `{"data": train_part}` via `skrub.var("data", train_part)`. If `valid_part` is not wrapped the same way, the learner may receive input in an inconsistent format.

